German airport worker dies of malaria from mosquito carried on plane
A worker at Germany’s Frankfurt airport has died after contracting malaria from a mosquito thought to have arrived on a plane, an airport spokesman said Wednesday.
Secretary announces government organ downsizing, effective from September
The ongoing shake-up of government organs is expected to finish in November, Secretary for Administration and Justice Wong Sio Chak told reporters on Wednesday.",success,,MILITARY,,,190,4,-10.0,-3.61111111111111,26.0928,-10.6089,4,https://www.macaubusiness.com/polisario-commander-western-sahara-fighters-killed-by-drone/,www.macaubusiness.com,True,False,2023-09-02
