Vijay Prashad is an Indian historian, editor and journalist. He is a writing fellow and chief correspondent at Globetrotter. He is the chief editor of LeftWord Books and the director of Tricontinental: Institute for Social Research. He is a senior non-resident fellow at Chongyang Institute for Financial Studies, Renmin University of China. He has written more than 20 books, including The Darker Nations and The Poorer Nations. His latest book is Washington Bullets, with an introduction by Evo Morales Ayma.",success,MOROCCAN,,MAR,,196,4,-9.5,-0.74380165289256,21.2167,-17.0167,4,https://www.pressenza.com/2022/01/morocco-drives-a-war-in-western-sahara-for-its-phosphates/,www.pressenza.com,False,False,2022-01-21
